    42	
    43	1. **The plank (first light).** The page still untouched on its oilcloth; Karis packs it. Pike pins the slip that came over in yesterday's bag: *Clearance. The cut below the shoulder hold, on the border road, two days west.* Twenty. Vastin sits on the settle at the door end of the eave; he is on no sheet. Everybody reads which road it is. **"Ours" (Karis). "Ours" (Brom).** Karis has never claimed a job before.
