    50	
    51	1. **A grey thing (dawn).** The copper has frost on it. A stillhound keeps its distance beside the road for half a mile. Seln's hand; six people and a mule become posts; Vastin does it right, at the ditch, and is told so by nobody. What he learned: it did not look at him.
