   107	"No." Seln did not soften it. "The paper is drawn against whatever attaches to an unclassified person, until his status is settled. For three of you that is a certificate. You have none, and so the thing that it holds is you. There is an order for a room and an hour. Its hour fell after we were gone, and the code keeps an hour whether anybody stands in the room or not. Inside a district it would be kept again, and you would be produced."
