   117	It was what she did at every gate before she left it, and Cael had seen it done at a mill and at a heap of stones. She did not sit to it. She went round the fold at her own distance from each, and asked before she put out a hand, and said what she found to the person and to nobody else; but the fold was small, and all of them heard all of it.
