universe/STATE_LEDGER.md:192:**The Quieting and the Fractured Path:** inside all three entered sites (Ring, Stair, Hall) every Arbiter in the party went silent at a perimeter that can be paced (a perfect circle, 200 m radius at the Ring; the fourth site 400 m and cordoned) and Cael's fragments worked unchanged. Five people know (Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, Oryn). **The Compact does not** — the rim at the Stair saw a practitioner walk out of quiet ground declaring; it saw nothing work inside (Ch19; stated on the page).
