codex
The protected source resolves all six markers and confirms the contested speakers: Vastin owns the wall/fields lesson, Cael owns “You do now,” Karis owns “Two copies…,” and the close runs Vastin → Karis → Cael. The source also shows that the draft’s cut geography is a real plan conflict, not a harmless expansion: Cael’s planned station is twenty strides west past the sink, whereas the draft turns that distance into the bait mark and walks him back.
