490:Book 9 opens with: the court's centre (no edge; "the same kind of made"); the Rune finding that nobody else knows; the dark Arbiter; the instruments trending wrong; the crack; Vastin unadmitted (Book 9 stages his formal request and the 3–2 vote, with Seln deciding); Oryn's three future holds and "After the thaw: bring the map, and lie still when I say."; Teague's "After the next thaw" and his grief; Cleon under Treswick; thirteen fragments; the leaf's copies with the gap drawn; the mule with Oryn; Cael remains nineteen at the Book 9 opening. Do not place or calculate his next birthday until the owner rules the series calendar. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: OWNER-pending #48] Book 9 owns the tomb in the deepest edge territory, the word "recurrence", the Compact's open fracture (Seln's documents), and the Quieting's first visible spread into a city's outer districts. **Do not pre-pay any of these in Book 8.**
26:**Cael knows:** ten fragments with current costs/deployment notes; deployment since the Line is 27. The still place is a location under the breastbone, read three times, with all ten going round it and none through; `Not the Quiet. Not a fragment.` He has obeyed the no-touch order. Four sites lie on one map edge: Ring, Stair and Hall entered; fourth unentered, unnamed, undated and untested at 440 yards and two strides radius behind stake 34 repeated one per pace. The three entered sites stop live Arbiters while his already-dark Arbiter remains dark and his fragments answer. He has no Path; nobody knows why. He knows the kit's radius line, 41-kind index, stroke/bar and `third site confirmed on bearing`; Karis's `Someone made this pattern.` remains unanswered.
32:**Lira knows:** the mechanism and still-place description; the three entered sites; and the fourth site's outside survey, repeated stake 34 and unknown effect. She did not cross or test it.
34:**Brom knows:** the mechanism and still-place description; the three entered sites; and the fourth site's outside survey, repeated stake 34 and unknown effect. He refused entry without Oryn and without knowing what the larger circle would do.
36:**Karis knows:** 52 sheets (11 Ring / 29 Stair / 12 Hall); 41 kinds at Ring/Stair and 33 of those 41 on the sampled Hall wall; the three centres lie on one straight edge and a fourth circle lies on that line. She knows the fourth site's outside measurements but has no sheet from inside it. Her larger hypothesis is unspoken and unentered. She knows `[UNBOUND]` only as the one-time stratum limit from Book 7 edition `chapter-42.md:269`; she does not yet know what the kit's index indexes.
38:**Seln knows:** the faction's craft, the completion report went west, the rival clock, the dead surveyor's paper and the fourth site's outside survey. His case remains unopened and undecided.
40:**Oryn knows:** the mechanism by Path, the full still-place telling and label, and the three entered sites on one bearing. She left at the day-122 fork and does not know the day-123 fourth-site survey or result at entry.
55:- **Living purse:** 96 marks (102 less six paid to the lower inn for the back room through the cold term). Hearth space for five is covered by standing-money. Two letters went west at a copper each.
56:- **Separate reserve:** cart-and-gelding reserve sealed under five thumbprints in the third box; unopened and unspent. Never merge it into the living purse.
59:- **Kit:** tarred-canvas case and strap; cord knotted at the fives; unused stake 32 with stroke/bar and bright turned point; mallet. Dead surveyor's ledger shut beside it. No pen.
