editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-notes.md:110:- Fragment rules hold: Wind locks one count (51:21–33); Storm's one lane bills ten counts (51:37–49, 207–213); Compression takes the crossbow blow at contact (51:51–59); Ember is one point (51:73–83); Anchor unbinds at touch (50:281–295); Tide requires the person's consent and physical contact (47:97–123; 48:11–53, 73–105). Deployment advances from thirteen to fourteen with the consensual Tide read (48:273–281), then nine Stair uses make twenty-three (51:193–217).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-notes.md:113:- Bodies hold: Brom's bolt crosses the right shoulder, misses lung/major vessel, remains as a plug until Tide returns, then is drawn and mended for an hour (49:237–273; 51:125–153). Lira's ankle gives on step twenty and the forearm reopens at two newest points; the arm is rebound and mended, still barred from use (49:281–301; 51:143–153). Cael's right forearm takes the crossbow strike through Compression and his left palm is burned by Ember (51:47–83, 157–163). Oryn empties three times at Millrace, then spends two more mendings after the Stair (47:43–85; 51:125–153).
