+53. `manuscript/chapter-17.md`
+   old: `"The place. He has written it against the fifth column, under the word that they all write." Her finger lay beside the ruled space, not on it. "He was a man who lived among instruments. He knew how a made thing behaves: it does the same at every hour, for every person who comes to it, and it has an edge that you could rule. That is what he found at the line. And then he has written that it cannot be one."`
+   new: `"The place. He has written it against the fifth column, under the word that they all write." Her finger lay beside the ruled space, not on it. "That is all the remark tells us. I shall not give his four words a fifth."`
