+98. `manuscript/chapter-19.md`
+   old: `"Did it bite?" said Lira.`
+   new: `"Still no?" said Lira.`
+
+99. `manuscript/chapter-19.md`
+   old: `"I said that it wouldn't."`
+   new: `"I said that you needn't."`
