+63. `manuscript/chapter-17.md`
+   old: `"It has a square. A printer cut a block with a ruled place in it, and a heading over the place, for a clerk to fill. Nobody rules a place on a form for a thing that is always the same." She was speaking very fast now, and very small. "It is a class. It is the kind of thing that a certificate has, at its head, where it says what its bearer is. And I shall tell you one thing more, and then I shall stop, since I can see the edge of what I know. On the sheets of the fifth place, that square is not filled as ours are."`
+   new: `"It has a square. A printer cut a block with a ruled place in it, and a heading over the place, for a clerk to fill. Nobody rules a place on a form for a thing that is always the same." She was speaking very fast now, and very small. "It is a class. It is the kind of thing that a certificate has, at its head, where it says what its bearer is. That is the edge of what I know, and I shall stop there."`
