+71. `manuscript/chapter-18.md`
+   old: `He did it first as he had been taught to, taking off. Then he did it the other way about, from the day that he remembered, adding, to see whether he came back to the figure on the sheet. He checked the year. He turned the sheet over, and looked at the brush's work on its back, and turned it again. He read the technician's date a figure at a time, with his thumb moving under it, as he had not read anything since he was a junior. He tried it a third time by a different road, through the day column of the abstract that had lain next to it in the row.`
+   new: `He checked the year. He checked the day within it. He worked from the sheet toward the file date that he remembered, and then from the remembered date back toward the sheet. He turned the sheet over, looked at the brush's work on its back, and turned it again. He read the technician's date a figure at a time, with his thumb moving under it, as he had not read anything since he was a junior. He tried the comparison a third time by a different order.`
+
+72. `manuscript/chapter-18.md`
+   old: `That was all. The boy could read a registry date; he had read them upside down on other people's desks for as long as Seln had known him. He had heard the difference given an hour ago, and he forgot nothing that had a number in it. If the sheet lay before him he would turn it, or he would not. If he did not, it was not yet his to carry. If he did, then he might write it or burn it, and tell five people or none. Nobody alive would have the right to ask him what he had made of it. Seln would least of all, having said nothing.`
+   new: `That was all. The boy could read a Compact date; he had read them upside down on other people's desks for as long as Seln had known him, and he forgot nothing that had a number in it. If the sheet lay before him he would make the comparison, or he would not. If he did not, it was not yet his to carry. If he did, then he might write it or burn it, and tell five people or none. Nobody alive would have the right to ask him what he had made of it. Seln would least of all, having said nothing.`
+
+73. `manuscript/chapter-18.md`
+   old: `It told him nothing, at first. It was near a date that he knew, and it was not that date. He had read a great many, upside down, on a great many desks, and they were all of them near to one another. He would have left it there. But a man on a stick had said this morning that a return which came up from a station was dated in the stations' count, and had to be turned. He had said by how much.`
+   new: `It was a Compact date, in the same count as a date that he knew. He had read a great many upside down on a great many desks, and he would have left it among them; but a quiet man had stopped over this one by a lamp, and had now set it before him without a word.`
