+100. `manuscript/chapter-19.md`
+   old: `He lifted his hand. Karis folded the cloth over the sheet without a word, and put it back inside her coat, where it had ridden; and her small pale face had nothing in it that could have been written down.`
+   new: `He had not touched it. Karis folded the cloth over the sheet without a word, and put it back inside her coat, where it had ridden; and her small pale face had nothing in it that could have been written down.`
