+101. `manuscript/chapter-19.md`
+   old: `They went down off the rise in file: a quiet man in front, and a girl with a case in her left hand, and a big one with a box, and a small one with a hide. A boy of nineteen came after them, who had been taken to a great many registries in his life, and sent for by some, and filed in all of them. Last came an old man on a stick, who had been a marshal and was learning to be nobody. Cael had never before walked toward such a place because he had chosen to. He kept his eyes on the lowest wall.`
+   new: `They went down off the rise in file: a quiet man in front, and a girl with a box, and a big one with a box, and a small one with a hide and the flat. A boy of nineteen came after them with the third box, who had been taken to a great many registries in his life, and sent for by some, and filed in all of them. Last came an old man on a stick with the tarred kit case, who had been a marshal and was learning to be nobody. Cael had never before walked toward such a place because he had chosen to. He kept his eyes on the lowest wall.`
