+69. `manuscript/chapter-18.md`
+   old: `A sum done in the head, by lamplight, over another person's shoulder, at the end of such a day, by a man who would have paid a year's wages for it to come out otherwise, was not a finding. He might have taken one figure for another. He might have had the difference wrong; it was a long while since he had needed it. He might, after fifteen years of files, have laid the wrong day at the head of the right one. There were three places where he could have slipped, and he had spent two days on a road going over each of the three.`
+   new: `A sum done in the head, by lamplight, over another person's shoulder, at the end of such a day, by a man who would have paid a year's wages for it to come out otherwise, was not a finding. He might have taken one figure for another. He might, after fifteen years of files, have laid the wrong day at the head of the right one. There were places where he could have slipped, and he had spent two days on a road going over each of them.`
